id: spirit-sword-rush
name: Spirit Sword Rush
advancement: true
prerequisite: Agility Score of 6+
tpCost: 5
swordProfile: combination
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spirit Sword with the Combination (Physical) Profile, if you like.
text: >
  Spirit Sword Rush: You unleash a series of deadly attacks in a row.
  –Prerequisites: Agility Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: You may use the Combination (Physical) Profile instead of the Simple (Physical) Profile for the effects of
  Spirit Sword.
